# This repo lives inside a shared workspace folder that contains many other,
# unrelated projects. Default to ignoring EVERYTHING, then explicitly allow only
# the TaskFlow files. This keeps `git add .` from ever pulling in other projects
# or the large archive files that sit alongside this project.
/*

# --- TaskFlow files to track ---
!/.gitignore
!/.dockerignore
!/README.md
!/Dockerfile
!/docker-compose.yml
!/TaskFlow.sln
!/TaskFlow-Architecture.md
!/src/
!/deploy/

# --- Within the allowed folders, apply normal .NET ignores ---
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/.vs/
**/artifacts/
**/publish/
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/

# Local secrets / runtime data
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/App_Data/
*.env

# OS / logs
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
**/logs/
*.log
